{"seq":2,"slug":"gateway-observability-capacity","title":"网关可观测性与容量度量：RED/USE 指标、访问日志、链路追踪与压测基线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-gateway-api-ingress-controller-routing/gateway-controller-impl-ops/gateway-observability-capacity","wordCount":2513,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"网关可观测性与容量度量-red-use-指标-访问日志-链路追踪与压测基线\">网关可观测性与容量度量：RED/USE 指标、访问日志、链路追踪与压测基线</h1><p>网关是整条请求链路上<strong>唯一必然经过</strong>的一跳：客户端每个字节都先落到数据面 Pod，再由它转发给后端 Service。红利是——在这里埋点，一次覆盖全站流量；陷阱是——网关同时是共享容量瓶颈，一旦连接池、CPU 或文件描述符打满，故障会以「全站 5xx」而非「某个服务慢」的形式瞬间扩散。因此网关可观测性要求三件事同时成立：<strong>指标能在秒级告诉你 SLO 是否破了、日志能定位到具体哪个请求、容量基线能在流量翻倍前告诉你该加几个副本</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-red-看服务-use-看资源-压测看拐点\">核心概念：RED 看服务、USE 看资源、压测看拐点</h2><p>监控网关时最容易犯的错，是只盯一两个「看起来很重要」的数字（比如 CPU 使用率）。网关的可观测性需要三套正交的透镜：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RED</strong> 描述「这个路由服务得好不好」：<strong>R</strong>ate（每秒请求数）、<strong>E</strong>rrors（错误率）、<strong>D</strong>uration（时延分布），由 Google SRE 体系推广为面向请求的黄金指标（<a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/monitoring-distributed-systems/\">Google SRE Book, Monitoring Distributed Systems</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>USE</strong> 描述「这个资源有没有被压垮」：<strong>U</strong>tilization（利用率）、<strong>S</strong>aturation（排队/饱和度）、<strong>E</strong>rrors（资源级错误），由 Brendan Gregg 提出（<a href=\"https://www.brendangregg.com/usemethod.html\">brendangregg.com/usemethod.html</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>压测基线</strong> 把前两者的阈值锚定在真实硬件上：单副本在多少 QPS 下时延中位数开始上翘，就是「拐点」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者的关系是：RED 告诉你用户是否受影响，USE 告诉你为什么，压测基线告诉你还能撑多久。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    C[客户端] --&gt; G[网关数据面 Pod]&#10;    G --&gt; R[RED: 请求速率/错误/时延]&#10;    G --&gt; U[USE: CPU/内存/连接池/FD]&#10;    G --&gt; L[访问日志: 每请求一条结构化记录]&#10;    G --&gt; T[Trace: traceparent 透传给后端]&#10;    R --&gt; S{SLI 是否破 SLO}&#10;    S --&gt;|是| A[用 USE 定位资源瓶颈]&#10;    A --&gt; H[按压测基线扩容或调参]&#10;    L --&gt; D[单请求级排障]&#10;    T --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n    C[客户端] --&gt; G[网关数据面 Pod]\n    G --&gt; R[RED: 请求速率/错误/时延]\n    G --&gt; U[USE: CPU/内存/连接池/FD]\n    G --&gt; L[访问日志: 每请求一条结构化记录]\n    G --&gt; T[Trace: traceparent 透传给后端]\n    R --&gt; S{SLI 是否破 SLO}\n    S --&gt;|是| A[用 USE 定位资源瓶颈]\n    A --&gt; H[按压测基线扩容或调参]\n    L --&gt; D[单请求级排障]\n    T --&gt; D</pre><p>数据面的<strong>两套指标体系</strong>是分开采集的：Envoy 作为数据面用自带的 stats 子系统导出（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/operations/stats\">Envoy Stats</a>），而 Istio/Envoy Gateway 在其上再包一层，转成 Prometheus 友好的名称。理解二者的对应关系，才能在告警里选对指标名。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>透镜</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>代表指标</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RED</td>\n<td>路由服务得好不好</td>\n<td><code>istio_requests_total</code>、<code>istio_request_duration_milliseconds</code></td>\n<td>Istio standard metrics</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USE</td>\n<td>资源是否饱和</td>\n<td><code>envoy_server_memory_allocated</code>、<code>envoy_cluster_upstream_cx_active</code></td>\n<td>Envoy stats</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访问日志</td>\n<td>哪个请求出了问题</td>\n<td><code>response_code</code>、<code>upstream_host</code>、<code>duration</code></td>\n<td>Envoy access log</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trace</td>\n<td>慢在哪一跳</td>\n<td>span duration、parent-child</td>\n<td>OTel / W3C Trace Context</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"red-指标-从-envoy-计数器到-prometheus-直方图\">RED 指标：从 Envoy 计数器到 Prometheus 直方图</h2><p>Istio 的 standard metrics 是最省事的 RED 采集面。它对每个代理产出的 <code>istio_requests_total</code> 是一个带 <code>reporter</code>、<code>source_workload</code>、<code>destination_service</code>、<code>response_code</code> 等标签的 counter；时延用直方图 <code>istio_request_duration_milliseconds</code>（<a href=\"https://istio.io/latest/docs/reference/config/metrics/\">Istio Standard Metrics</a>）。启用 Gateway API 的 <code>HTTPRoute</code> 后，标签里会出现 <code>route_name</code> 与 <code>gateway_name</code>，让「按路由」聚合成为可能——这正是网关场景下最有用的维度。</p>\n<p><strong>压缩时延直方图是核心。</strong> 桶边界设错，百分位就毫无意义：若 95% 的请求落在 10ms 内，而桶只有 <code>25/50/100/250ms</code> 几档，<code>histogram_quantile</code> 只能在 0–25ms 间线性插值，误差可达数十毫秒。Prometheus 较新版本提供 <strong>native histograms</strong>，用指数桶大幅降低配置成本（<a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/specs/native_histograms/\">Prometheus native histograms</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>标签基数是网关监控的头号杀手。</strong> 把 <code>request.url</code>、<code>user_id</code>、<code>x-request-id</code> 这类高基数维度写进指标标签，时间序列数会爆炸，内存和抓取耗时同时失控。指标标签只保留<strong>低基数的分类维度</strong>（路由名、方法、状态码类、上游集群），高基数细节留给日志和 trace。</p>\n<h2 id=\"use-指标-连接池与文件描述符才是真瓶颈\">USE 指标：连接池与文件描述符才是真瓶颈</h2><p>在网关数据面上，CPU 往往不是第一个被打满的资源。更早触顶的通常是<strong>上游连接池</strong>和<strong>文件描述符</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>USE 维度</th>\n<th>资源</th>\n<th>代表 Envoy 统计量</th>\n<th>饱和表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Utilization</td>\n<td>CPU</td>\n<td><code>envoy_server_cpu</code></td>\n<td>TLS 握手变慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Utilization</td>\n<td>内存</td>\n<td><code>envoy_server_memory_allocated</code></td>\n<td>OOMKill，Pod 重启</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Saturation</td>\n<td>上游连接池</td>\n<td><code>envoy_cluster_upstream_cx_active</code>、<code>_pending</code></td>\n<td>请求排队，时延尾部分位飙升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Saturation</td>\n<td>下游连接</td>\n<td><code>envoy_listener_downstream_cx_active</code></td>\n<td>新连接被拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Errors</td>\n<td>连接建立</td>\n<td><code>envoy_cluster_upstream_cx_connect_fail</code></td>\n<td>5xx 由网关自产</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>连接池是理解网关容量的关键。Envoy 默认对每个上游集群维护有限的 HTTP 连接池，当并发请求数超过池上限时，多余请求进入 pending 队列；队列也满时触发 overflow 并直接失败。用<strong>利特尔法则</strong>量化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\times W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是在途请求数（约等于连接池占用），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是到达速率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是平均处理时间。若某后端 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W=50\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2000</mn><mtext> req/s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=2000\\ \\text{req/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2000</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">req/s</span></span></span></span></span></span>，则在途请求约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>，连接池上限必须显著大于 100，否则排队会长尾化时延。</p>\n<p><strong>TLS 是不可忽略的 CPU 成本。</strong> 网关若做 TLS 终止，握手阶段的非对称运算会瞬时吃掉大量 CPU；当会话复用率低（客户端不重用连接）时，CPU 会成为第一个瓶颈。配置细节见跨章节的 <a href=\"../tls-gamma-service-ingress/tls-termination-certificate-lifecycle\">TLS 终止与证书生命周期</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"访问日志-结构化字段-采样与脱敏\">访问日志：结构化字段、采样与脱敏</h2><p>访问日志回答的是「<strong>具体哪一个请求</strong>」出了问题，这是指标和 trace 都无法完全替代的粒度。做对它有三个要求。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，必须是结构化 JSON。</strong> 纯文本日志无法被可靠地解析聚合。Envoy 支持自定义 access log 格式输出 JSON，字段至少应包含：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>排障用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>start_time</code> / <code>duration</code></td>\n<td>对齐 trace、定位慢请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>response_code</code> / <code>response_flags</code></td>\n<td>状态码；网关内部状态（如 <code>UF</code> 上游连接失败、<code>NR</code> 无路由），区分责任方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>upstream_host</code></td>\n<td>实际命中的后端 Pod，判断是否单实例故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>traceparent</code> / <code>x-request-id</code></td>\n<td>关联 ID，串起全链路</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>response_flags</code> 是网关访问日志里价值最高的字段：它把「5xx」这个笼统信号进一步拆成「上游超时 <code>/UT</code>」「上游连接被重置 <code>/URX</code>」「未找到路由 <code>/NR</code>」等具体原因。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，必须做脱敏与默认最小化。</strong> URL 的 query string、<code>Authorization</code>、<code>Cookie</code> 里经常夹带 token、邮箱、地址等个人数据。日志的默认姿态应当是<strong>只记录不敏感的字段</strong>，而非「先全量记录再事后清洗」：把完整的 query 和 header 排除在日志 schema 之外，或对 query 值做哈希，仅在确有排障需要且控制在受控范围内时才临时打开明细——GDPR/个保法下的请求日志可能构成个人数据处理。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，必须做采样。</strong> 高流量网关每天可产生数十亿条日志，全量落盘既贵又会淹没有用记录。常见策略是：错误请求 100% 记录，成功请求按比例采样（如 1%–5%），特定路由可单独调采样率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"链路追踪-用-w3c-trace-context-贯通网关与后端\">链路追踪：用 W3C Trace Context 贯通网关与后端</h2><p>网关是 trace 的<strong>天然入口</strong>：所有外部请求在这里首次进入系统，所以这里生成的 <code>traceparent</code> 头会顺着转发链一路传到后端服务，把原本割裂的 span 缝合成一棵完整的调用树。协议基础是 W3C Trace Context，<code>traceparent</code> 里携带 <code>trace-id</code>、<code>parent-id</code> 与采样标志（<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/trace-context/\">W3C Trace Context</a>）。</p>\n<p>网关侧要做三件事：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>透传而非覆盖</strong>：请求头里已有合法 <code>traceparent</code> 时沿用，没有时新建；绝不用网关生成的 ID 覆盖上游已有值，否则跨系统链路会被切断。</li>\n<li><strong>正确标注 span 类型</strong>：入站 span 为 server 类型，出站转发为 client 类型，符合 OpenTelemetry 的 HTTP semantic conventions（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/semconv/http/\">OTel HTTP Semantic Conventions</a>），上下游 span 才能在同一视图对齐。</li>\n<li><strong>尾部采样</strong>：在 OpenTelemetry Collector 层按「是否包含错误」「时延超过阈值」决定保留哪些 trace，比入口处的头部采样更能保住有诊断价值的样本。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>链路追踪和指标、日志的互补关系是：指标说「错误率涨了」，trace 说「错误都发生在 网关→支付服务 这一跳」，日志说「那一跳的 response_flags 是 <code>UF</code>」。三者缺一，排障就得靠猜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"压测与容量基线-找到拐点再谈副本数\">压测与容量基线：找到拐点再谈副本数</h2><p>所有阈值最终都要用压测锚定，否则告警数字只是拍脑袋。压测的目标不是「跑到最大 QPS」，而是找到<strong>时延拐点</strong>：在哪个并发下，时延中位数仍然平坦，但 P99 开始指数上翘。</p>\n<p>用 k6、Locust 或 vegeta 这类工具对网关入口发压，逐步提高并发（阶梯加压 ramp-up），观察 <code>istio_request_duration_milliseconds</code> 的 P50/P90/P99 曲线。健康的曲线是：低并发下三条分位几乎重合且平坦，到某个并发后 P99 先抬头，再往上 P50 也开始抬——<strong>P99 先抬头的那个点就是单副本的容量拐点</strong>。</p>\n<p>容量规划按下面的关系估算副本数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>replicas</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>knee</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{replicas}} = \\left\\lceil \\frac{\\lambda_{\\text{peak}} \\times (1 + h)}{Q_{\\text{knee}}} \\right\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">replicas</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">knee</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是峰值到达率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>knee</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{knee}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">knee</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单副本拐点 QPS，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 是预留余量（常见 30%–50%，用于应对突发、实例重启和节点故障）。举例：峰值 8000 req/s、单副本拐点 2500、余量 40%，则需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mn>8000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2500</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil 8000 \\times 1.4 / 2500 \\rceil = 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord\">8000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.4/2500</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 个副本。这个数字就是 HPA 的目标下限，上限应留出跨节点漂移的空间。</p>\n<p><strong>基线要可复现。</strong> 压测必须固定输入变量（请求体大小、TLS 开关、是否开启访问日志、后端响应时延），否则两次压测不可比。特别注意：<strong>开启全量访问日志会显著降低单副本吞吐</strong>，很多团队压测时忘了这一点，导致线上开启日志后容量幻觉破灭。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>网关可观测性由三套正交通道构成：<strong>RED</strong> 看请求、<strong>USE</strong> 看资源、<strong>压测基线</strong>锚定阈值；缺一套就只能靠猜排障。</li>\n<li>RED 用 <code>istio_requests_total</code> + <code>istio_request_duration_milliseconds</code> 直方图；<strong>标签基数必须压低</strong>，高基数维度留给日志。</li>\n<li>USE 的关键资源是<strong>上游连接池</strong>与<strong>文件描述符</strong>，而非 CPU；利特尔法则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 把并发换算成连接池需求。</li>\n<li>访问日志用结构化 JSON，以 <code>response_flags</code>、<code>upstream_host</code> 定位责任方；默认脱敏，错误全采、成功按比例采样。</li>\n<li>链路追踪依赖 W3C Trace Context 的<strong>透传</strong>，网关生成入口 span，Collector 层做尾部采样。</li>\n<li>容量规划从<strong>单副本时延拐点</strong>出发，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>knee</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = \\lceil \\lambda(1+h)/Q_{\\text{knee}} \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">knee</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span> 换算副本数。</li>\n<li>排障顺序：指标发现异常 → trace 定位跳数 → 日志读出具体原因。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：路由与流量切分行为见 <a href=\"../routing-traffic-splitting-extensions/httproute-matching-filters\">HTTPRoute 匹配与过滤器</a>，金丝雀发布时的指标对比见 <a href=\"../routing-traffic-splitting-extensions/traffic-splitting-canary-progressive-delivery\">流量切分与渐进式交付</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网关可观测性与容量度量：RED/USE 指标、访问日志、链路追踪与压测基线","id":"网关可观测性与容量度量-red-use-指标-访问日志-链路追踪与压测基线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：RED 看服务、USE 看资源、压测看拐点","id":"核心概念-red-看服务-use-看资源-压测看拐点"},{"level":2,"text":"RED 指标：从 Envoy 计数器到 Prometheus 直方图","id":"red-指标-从-envoy-计数器到-prometheus-直方图"},{"level":2,"text":"USE 指标：连接池与文件描述符才是真瓶颈","id":"use-指标-连接池与文件描述符才是真瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"访问日志：结构化字段、采样与脱敏","id":"访问日志-结构化字段-采样与脱敏"},{"level":2,"text":"链路追踪：用 W3C Trace Context 贯通网关与后端","id":"链路追踪-用-w3c-trace-context-贯通网关与后端"},{"level":2,"text":"压测与容量基线：找到拐点再谈副本数","id":"压测与容量基线-找到拐点再谈副本数"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"网关控制器架构：调谐循环、配置翻译与数据面（Envoy/NGINX/xDS）下发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-gateway-api-ingress-controller-routing/gateway-controller-impl-ops/controller-architecture-reconciliation"},"next":{"title":"网关升级与故障运维：CRD 版本迁移、重载风暴、多租户隔离与故障处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-gateway-api-ingress-controller-routing/gateway-controller-impl-ops/upgrade-failure-incident-runbook"}}